sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Scheduling Service
    participant Repo as IServiceAppointmentCalendarSyncRepository
    participant Db as ServiceAppointmentCalendarSyncs

    App->>Repo: GetByAppointmentIdAsync(appointmentId)
    Repo->>Db: Select por AppointmentId
    Db-->>Repo: registro ou null
    Repo-->>App: resultado

    alt nao existe
        App->>Repo: AddAsync(sync: Pending)
        Repo->>Db: Insert
        Db-->>Repo: ok
        Repo-->>App: ok
    else existe
        App->>Repo: UpdateAsync(sync: Synced/Failed/Deleted)
        Repo->>Db: Update (GoogleEventId, LastSyncAtUtc, Error, SyncStatus)
        Db-->>Repo: ok
        Repo-->>App: ok
    end
